## Copy this file to "local.properties" (same folder) before opening in Android Studio.
## Android Studio normally generates local.properties automatically the first time
## you open the project and point it at your SDK — you usually do NOT need to edit
## this manually.
sdk.dir=/path/to/your/Android/sdk

## If you enable the Google Maps screen (see README "Configuration Maps"),
## put your Maps API key in local.properties too, NEVER in source control:
MAPS_API_KEY=YOUR_API_KEY_HERE
